runs will now correctly appear as wins in the run history.Added a Play Again button to the demo completion screen.Upgrade offers now display the actual number of levels gained when approaching the level cap.A","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T22:56:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679497","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4631490-1846651706675022","game_id":"steam-4631490","kind":"announcement","title":"The SU-93 Survivor demo is now available!","summary":"Hello everyone,The SU-93 Survivor demo is finally available on Steam!SU-93 Survivor is a tactical survivor-like where you progress room after room inside a corrupted robot. Each room is a new fight, a new choice, and a new opportunity to adapt your build.The twist is simple:Your weapons can change between rooms, but your passive items stay and shape your entire run.This means you constantly have to rebuild your arsenal around the synergies you have already collected. Choose your path, fight wave","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T17:03:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706675022","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4631490-1835871199307337","game_id":"steam-4631490","kind":"update","title":"UI/UX Update for playtest","summary":"Highlights- Lab flow was adjusted so the lab menu controls enemy spawning more explicitly, and the default training enemy was removed from the lab room. - Character selection received a major presentation pass: a terminal-inspired layout, cleaner passive cards, revised keycap drawing, updated room setup, selectable character thumbnails, and player tint placeholders. - Map navigation was rebuilt into a branching tree with terminal-style panels, room icons/sprites, selected-room highlighting, and ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-19T14:33:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199307337","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4631490-1834602721198936","game_id":"steam-4631490","kind":"update","title":"Playtest Major Update","summary":"New Weapon, New enemies Gameplay and Balance- Added the new **Blackhole** weapon, including its weapon factory, unlock entry, weapon database registration, projectile object behavior, attraction radius/strength tuning, lifespan, scaling, and evolved EX behavior. - Added new **Bug Warrior** and **Bug Tank** enemy assets/objects, including Bug Tank corruption-on-death behavior that corrupts nearby enemies. - Rebalanced enemy health and rewards across basic, fast, bug warrior, bug tank, and parent ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-08T13:53:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721198936","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4631490-1831432155562226","game_id":"steam-4631490","kind":"announcement","title":"SU-93 Survivor: Playtest Now!","summary":"PlaytestHello everyone,My name is Nico, and I’m a solo developer working on the first game from my studio, Summer 93 Studio.My goal is to make the best version of the game possible. This playtest is focused on the first two biomes of the game and on the gameplay experience.Some interface elements may still be changed if they are too disruptive, but for now that is not the main priority.Before going into more detail, if you’d like to support the game, feel free to wishlist it!Gameplay Ove